  "description": "EZIFAX crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C114 H98 Ho4 N6 O24,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho3A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.714-3.917 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.41-112.77°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C116H106Ho4N6O26.",
